      310.97,
      400.92,
      370.31
    ],
    "text": "2.Section 2 of the Appropriation Act, No. 7 of 2020 ishereby amended in paragraph (b) of subsection (1) thereof,by the substitution for the words, \u201crupees two thousand ninehundred ninety seven billion\u201d of the words \u201crupees threethousand three hundred ninety seven billion\u201d.",
